  template: concept
  status: spike
  covers:
    - The layers, bottom to top: transport, Teleport, signaling, swarm, extensions, in one diagram
    - Which package holds each layer in `packages/core/mesh`: `network-manager`, `teleport`, `messaging`, the `teleport-extension-*` packages and `edge-client`
    - The worker-to-tab RPC packages (`rpc`, `rpc-tunnel`, `websocket-rpc`) are not part of these pages [D-230]
```
