  status: spike
  covers:
    - The entry points: each device's WebSocket ends at the Router, and HTTP requests go to the `edge` worker, which forwards each to the service that owns its path [D-285]
    - The services, one line each: Router, DB, identity, compute, KMS, hub, AI, blob and registry
    - The Durable Objects per identity and per space, in a diagram
    - The development, preview and production environments, and how an app's config selects one
    - DXOS operates every environment; there is no self-hosted EDGE [D-237]
