```
```mdl
page edge-indexing: Indexing and queries
  EDGE's index of each space, and how a query uses it.
  section: EDGE
  route: /docs/edge/concepts/indexing/
  group: Core concepts
  template: concept
  status: spike
  covers:
    - The index EDGE keeps of each space it can read; a space that grants EDGE only `pull` access has none
    - A query merges local results with EDGE's, which ECHO treats as evidence, not authority
    - The index trails the latest changes; queries are live and never complete
```
