decision D-171: HALO's path is built as ECHO's is [D-137] [D-138] [D-140]: the embeds run in-memory clients in device frames; the StackBlitz projects are real clients on EDGE with the browser's private file system; the starter replaces each quoted region with `todo()`. Each page's code is one module of the app, and pages quote only modules the app runs. The app provides `Identity.Service` and `Space.Service` with `layerClient(client)` from `@dxos/halo-adapter-client`.
