decision D-172: Recover an identity's embed creates and revokes recovery codes live, on in-memory clients. `Identity.recover` goes through EDGE, which the embeds have no route to, so the step that recovers on a new device runs only in the StackBlitz project. HALO refuses to revoke the last recovery credential, so the page makes a second code before it revokes the first.
  date: 2026-11-11
  by: agent:claude
  affects: [halo-recover-identity]
