decision D-173: Every page that teaches recovery (Recover an identity, Recovery and credentials, Passkey recovery, and the Identity API page) carries a caution: recovery needs a DXOS account, because EDGE stores recovery credentials only for identities linked to one, and for now an account can be created only through Composer. The embeds keep showing recovery on in-memory clients.
  date: 2026-11-11
  by: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [halo-recover-identity, halo-recovery-credentials, halo-guide-passkey-recovery, halo-guide-identity]
