```mdl
decision D-205: The PLEX path goes Define a type, Add an operation, Add a surface, Extend the App Graph. Define a type registers the schema only. Add an operation starts with creating a bookmark, since the create-object module runs the Space plugin's AddObject operation, and then adds Record visit and its skill. Add a surface renders the bookmark and calls Record visit from its button. The create-object and operation-handler modules keep their names: other plugins name these modules the same way (`capabilities/create-object.ts`, `capabilities/operation-handler.ts`). The inspector lists module kinds in the new page order.
