```mdl
decision D-206: The PLEX path goes Define a type, Add an operation, Extend the App Graph, Add a surface, Run it in Composer, and the inspector lists module kinds in that order: Translations, Schema, Operations, Create object, App Graph, Surface, Skill. Add an operation defines Record visit first and then creates a bookmark through `AddObject`. The skill moves to Run it in Composer, as the step before the assistant runs Record visit. Amends [D-205].
