```mdl
decision D-207: On Extend the App Graph, each extension is a top-level `const` in `capabilities/app-graph-builder.ts`, so every sample is complete code that pastes as it is. A first step shows the file's imports once. The extension samples then show only their own code, numbered as the file is (`bare` on `Snippet`). A final code step shows the module that contributes the three extensions together. Amends [D-197] for this page.
